Package: crc16
Architecture: any
Description: compute many CRC-16 variants of files in a single pass
 crc16 calculates 31 CRC-16 variants of the Rocksoft/RevEng model, with
 their common aliases (MODBUS, X-25, XMODEM, CCITT-FALSE and others), for
 one or more files or standard input, reading the data only once.
 .
 Results can be printed as plain text, CSV, TSV or JSON. The program is
 multithreaded, uses carry-less multiply (PCLMULQDQ) folding on x86-64 CPUs
 that support it and falls back to portable slicing-by-8 code elsewhere.
